iv><div class="t m0 x95 h34 y2b8 ff4 fs8 fc1 sc0 ls0 ws0">服务器继续传送剩余数据<span class="ff3">...</span></div><div class="t m0 x7d h2d y29e ff6 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0">FIN=1<span class="ff3">,<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>A<span class="_ _4"></span>CK=1</div><div class="t m0 x92 h2d y29f ff6 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0">seq=w<span class="ff3">,<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>ack=u+1</div><div class="t m0 x94 h2d y2b9 ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">LAST<span class="_ _4"></span>-A<span class="_ _2c"></span>CK</div><div class="t m0 x59 h2d y2ba ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">TIME-<span class="_ _29"></span>W<span class="_ _2c"></span>AIT</div><div class="t m0 x96 h2d y2bb ff6 fs1 fca sc0 ls0 ws0">A<span class="_ _4"></span>CK=1<span class="ff3">, </span>seq=u+1<span class="ff3">,<span class="_ _7e"> </span></span>ack=w+1</div><div class="t m0 x94 h2d y2bc ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">CLOSED</div><div class="t m0 x34 h35 y2bd ff4 fs9 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">等待<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff3">2MSL</span></div><div class="t m0 x97 h35 y2be ff4 fs9 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">后关闭</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y2bf ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">6.6<span class="_ _24"> </span>TCP<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff1">拥塞控制<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>(Congestion<span class="_ _9"> </span>Control)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y2c0 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.6.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">基本概念与变量</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y2c1 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">拥塞控制是防止过多的数据注入到网络中，使网络中的路由器或链路不致过载。这是一个<span class="ff1">全局性</span>的过程。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y2c2 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">拥塞窗口<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(cwnd)<span class="ff3">:<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff4">发送方维护的一个状态变量，其大小取决于网络的拥塞程度，并动态变化。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y2c3 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">慢开始门限<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(ssthresh)<span class="ff3">:<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff4">用于区分“慢开始”和“拥塞避免”阶段的阈值。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y2c4 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">发送窗口上限<span class="ff3">:</span></div><div class="t m0 x5c h7 y2c5 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">发送窗口<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(swnd) <span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">min<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ffa">[<span class="_ _f"></span></span></span></span></span>接收端窗口<span class="_ _7e"> </span><span class="ff3">(r<span class="_ _f"></span>wnd)<span class="ff8">,<span class="_ _e"> </span></span></span>拥塞窗口<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(cwnd)<span class="ffa">]<span class="_ _87"> </span></span>(6.1)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y2c6 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.6.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">四大核心算法</span></div><div class="t m0 x3 h6 y2c7 ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff1">慢开始<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>(Slo<span class="_ _3"></span>w<span class="_ _7e"> </span>St<span class="_ _f"></span>art)</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y2c8 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">当主机开始发送数据时，由小到大逐渐增大<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">cwnd</span>。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y2c9 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">规则<span class="ff4">：每收到一个<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">A<span class="_ _29"></span>CK<span class="ff4">，<span class="ff10">cwnd<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>加<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>1<span class="ff4">（即经过一个<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>R<span class="_ _3"></span>TT<span class="ff4">，<span class="ff10">cwnd<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">加倍</span></span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y2ca ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">停止条件<span class="ff4">：当<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">cwnd<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">≥<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>ssthresh<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>时，改用拥塞避免算法。</span></div><div class="t m0 x3 h6 y2cb ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff1">拥塞避免<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>(Congestion<span class="_ _7e"> </span>A<span class="_ _4"></span>v<span class="_ _3"></span>oidance)</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y2cc ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">让<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">cwnd<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>缓慢增大，避免网络过早拥塞。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y2cd ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">规则<span class="ff4">：每经过一个往返时间<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">R<span class="_ _3"></span>TT<span class="ff4">，<span class="ff10">cwnd<span class="_ _7e"> </span><span class="ff1">加<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">1</span></span></span>（线性增长）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y2ce ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特点<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _2"></span><span class="ff1">“加法增大”<span class="ff6">(A<span class="_ _29"></span>dditive<span class="_ _8"> </span>Increase)<span class="ff4">。</span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x3 h6 y2cf ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff1">快重传<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>(F<span class="_ _29"></span>ast R<span class="_ _3"></span>etransmit)</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y2d0 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">为了让发送方尽早知道发生了个别报文段的丢失。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y2d1 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">触发<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _29"></span>接收方发现失序报文段，<span class="_ _3"></span>立即发出重复确认。<span class="_ _29"></span>发送方只要一连收到<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">3 <span class="ff1">个重复确认<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>(3-A<span class="_ _4"></span>CK)<span class="ff4">，<span class="_ _3"></span>就</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y2d2 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">立即重传，而不必等待超时计时器。</div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">21<span class="_ 